            "review_title": "Review at 7Fuku Izakaya",
            "review_text": "Linh H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nShould try\nJan 2024 • Friends\nThe menu boasts a delightful array of Japanese izakaya dishes, each crafted with precision and bursting with flavors. The sashimi was incredibly fresh, and the takoyaki was a savory delight. What impressed me the most was the attention to detail in each dish – a true testament to the chef's dedication to quality.\n\nThe service was impeccable. The staff was attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu. They offered excellent recommendations and made sure every aspect of our dining experience was enjoyable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 17, 2024",
